This archive is one UTC day of a Tally relay's globe history: what readsb, decoding the relay's
ADS-B, wrote for that day (each aircraft's trace and the heatmap), as the tally-map image packs it
(github.com/sky-commons/tally, packaging/map).

The data in it is made available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Each aircraft's registration, ICAO type code, type description and military and interesting
flags in it come from Mictronics' aircraft database, made available under the Open Data Commons
Attribution License (ODC-By) 1.0 (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/), at commit
@MICTRONICS_COMMIT@ of https://github.com/Mictronics/aircraft-database.
Attribution: Aircraft data: Mictronics aircraft database, ODC-By 1.0.
Its licence is LICENSE-aircraft-database, beside this file.
